<header>
<h1 class="p-name">SAMSUNG’S BUDGET FLAGSHIP | GALAXY F62 |</h1>
</header>
<section data-field="subtitle" class="p-summary">
The F stands for Full-on. F series is aimed at offering high performance at a relatively lower price. The first phone of this series was…
</section>
<section data-field="body" class="e-content">
<section name="98c7" class="section section--body section--first"><div class="section-divider"><hr class="section-divider"></div><div class="section-content"><div class="section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn"><h3 name="c6c8" id="c6c8" class="graf graf--h3 graf--leading graf--title">SAMSUNG’S BUDGET FLAGSHIP | GALAXY F62 |</h3><figure name="5182" id="5182" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--h3"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*60jRLE6XfReJkNxx.jpg" data-width="320" data-height="258" data-is-featured="true" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*60jRLE6XfReJkNxx.jpg"></figure><p name="6e26" id="6e26" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">The F stands for Full-on. F series is aimed at offering high performance at a relatively lower price. The first phone of this series was the f41 and it was aimed at the mid-range segment. The F62 is for the <strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">upper mid-range </strong>segment and it competes with higher mid-rangers like the Oneplus Nord and Realme X7 pro.</p><p name="48e4" id="48e4" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Samsung generally offers relatively lower specifications when compared to its Chinese competitors. But things have changed with F62. We’ll dive deep into the F62 in this blog. Do <a href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/%3Ca%20href=%22https://feedburner.google.com/fb/a/mailverify?uri=blogspot/lICUiI&amp;amp;loc=en_US%22%3ESubscribe%20to%20The%20Technobyte%20by%20Email%3C/a%3E" data-href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/%3Ca%20href=%22https://feedburner.google.com/fb/a/mailverify?uri=blogspot/lICUiI&amp;amp;loc=en_US%22%3ESubscribe%20to%20The%20Technobyte%20by%20Email%3C/a%3E" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">subscribe</a> if you are new here and share it with your friends.</p><figure name="f657" id="f657" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--p"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*_ZAKxXiTbBvLR1g5.jpeg" data-width="320" data-height="180" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*_ZAKxXiTbBvLR1g5.jpeg"></figure><p name="8dfe" id="8dfe" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">To give a better perspective, Exynos 9625 can be compared with <strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">Snapdragon 765G</strong> and 9625 is better than 765G in both CPU and GPU. It can handle day-to-day tasks seamlessly. It scored an Antutu benchmark score of 452000+.</p><figure name="5c63" id="5c63" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--p"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*2FCw-TO4oi0PlqkO.jpeg" data-width="320" data-height="206" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*2FCw-TO4oi0PlqkO.jpeg"></figure><p name="fa21" id="fa21" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">The battery capacity is the main USP(Unique Selling Point) of this smartphone. One of the disadvantages of Galaxy Note 10 was its battery life. But F62 has a massive <strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">7000 mah </strong>battery. The battery life should be pretty good in F62. Also, there’s a wired power share option. You can connect a type-C to type-C cable from your phone and can charge another phone.</p><figure name="53df" id="53df" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--p"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*_oTXoCRfCOCDjL_M.jpg" data-width="320" data-height="227" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*_oTXoCRfCOCDjL_M.jpg"></figure><p name="5d58" id="5d58" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">The second sensor is a <strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">12-megapixel</strong> ultra-wide camera with a 123-degree field of view. The last two are a five-megapixel depth and a five-megapixel macro sensor. On the front, It has a 32-megapixel camera for selfies and face unlock. It also has support forin both front and back and it also has support for single take.</p><p name="cc48" id="cc48" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Eventhough F62 has an Amoled display, it does not have an in-display fingerprint scanner. The finger print scanner is given on the right, which also acts a power button. F62 also has face unlock feature and quickly unlocks in both ways.</p><p name="449c" id="449c" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Overall F62 is a really good phone, especially from a tier-one brand. Samsung’s One UI is very reliable and smooth these days. F62 starts at 23999 for the 6GB RAM variant and 25999 for the 8GB RAM variant.</p><p name="4be3" id="4be3" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">In my opinion, the 6GB RAM variant is the best choice. In android, 6GB RAM is more than enough. There won’t be any major differences between 6GB RAM and 8GB RAM, considering the storage is 128GB for both the RAM variants. If you are looking to buy a smartphone in the 20 to 30K price segment, then F62 is a choice you should definitely check out.</p><p name="a9ac" id="a9ac" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing">Do <a href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/%3Ca%20href=%22https://feedburner.google.com/fb/a/mailverify?uri=blogspot/lICUiI&amp;amp;loc=en_US%22%3ESubscribe%20to%20The%20Technobyte%20by%20Email%3C/a%3E" data-href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/%3Ca%20href=%22https://feedburner.google.com/fb/a/mailverify?uri=blogspot/lICUiI&amp;amp;loc=en_US%22%3ESubscribe%20to%20The%20Technobyte%20by%20Email%3C/a%3E" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">subscribe</a> to enjoy more awesome content. Follow us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/the.technobyte/?igshid=fmvp9ng7bmu" data-href="https://www.instagram.com/the.technobyte/?igshid=fmvp9ng7bmu" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Instagram</a> to receive daily updates. Catch you up in the next blog. Bye.</p></div></div></section><section name="8e60" class="section section--body section--last"><div class="section-divider"><hr class="section-divider"></div><div class="section-content"><div class="section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn"><p name="ab3d" id="ab3d" class="graf graf--p graf--leading graf--trailing"><em class="markup--em markup--p-em">Originally published at </em><a href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2021/02/samsungs-budget-flagship-galaxy-f62.html" data-href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2021/02/samsungs-budget-flagship-galaxy-f62.html" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><em class="markup--em markup--p-em">https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com</em></a><em class="markup--em markup--p-em"> on February 23, 2021.</em></p></div></div></section>
</section>
<footer><p>By <a href="https://medium.com/@gokulrece23" class="p-author h-card">Gokul Rajan</a> on <a href="https://medium.com/p/7fec73ed9199"><time class="dt-published" datetime="2021-02-23T07:30:48.514Z">February 23, 2021</time></a>.</p><p><a href="https://medium.com/@gokulrece23/samsungs-budget-flagship-galaxy-f62-the-technobyte-7fec73ed9199" class="p-canonical">Canonical link</a></p><p>Exported from <a href="https://medium.com">Medium</a> on April 28, 2026.</p></footer></article></body></html>